.TH FORGEKIT-VERSION 1 "2026-08-25" "ForgeKit 0.3.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
forgekit-version \- Print version information
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forgekit version
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the ForgeKit version information including the version number and
build metadata.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug output
.TP
.B \-\-format \fIformat\fR
Output format: human, json (default: human)
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Reduce output (except errors and JSON)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Print version:
.B forgekit version
.TP
Print version with JSON output:
.B forgekit version --format json
.SH OUTPUT FORMAT
Human format:
.PP
.nf
forge version 0.3.4
Build • Extend • Ship
.fi
.PP
JSON format:
.PP
.nf
{
  "version": "0.3.4",
  "build_time": "2026-08-25T12:00:00Z",
  "git_commit": "abc1234"
}
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 2
Execution error
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forgekit (1)
.SH AUTHOR
ForgeKit Contributors <forgekit@demetrius-ch.github.io>